  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1808\">\n<p data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1585\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1583\">MLL/KMT2A Rearrangement Detected:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1808\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1705\">\n<p data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1705\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Indicates <strong data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1621\">11q23 abnormality</strong> commonly seen in <strong data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1702\">infant ALL, therapy-related AML, and some de novo leukemias</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1808\">\n<p data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1808\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Associated with <strong data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1747\">adverse prognosis</strong>; genetic counseling and targeted treatment planning advised.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1950\">\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1841\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1839\">MLL/KMT2A Not Detected:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1950\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1883\">\n<p data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1883\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No evidence of 11q23 rearrangement.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1950\">\n<p data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1950\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Correlate with other cytogenetics, NGS, and clinical features.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2084\">\n<p data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1974\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1972\">Clinical Note:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2084\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2084\">\n<p data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2084\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Should be interpreted with <strong data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2083\">morphology, immunophenotyping, cytogenetics, and other molecular findings</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
